{"abstract":"Previous research has emphasized the importance and potential of actively involving teachers in the design and implementation of educational technologies in schools. However, only a few studies have explored the development of methodologies for engaging teachers in the appropriation of digital technologies, as the increased digitalization of many education sectors demands. Drawing on experiences from two large-scale participatory research projects, this paper investigates two approaches to involving teachers in the design and implementation of digital learning platforms. Specifically, the paper draws on case examples to examine how participatory data design and future workshops can help to cultivate communities of practice in support of teachers’ appropriation of digital technologies.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Dirckinck-Holmfeld, Lone","Ipsen, Bertil Johannes","Tamborg, Andreas Lindenskov","Dreyøe, Jonas","Allsopp, Benjamin Brink","Misfeldt, Morten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-110685"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Dirckinck-Holmfeld, Lone"],"keyword":["Digitalisation","Educational technology","Future workshops"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"modes of teacher participation in the digitalization of school","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.16993/dfl.109","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-110685","identifier":[{"id":"85089343980","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-d0e45129-0ab5-479c-a315-8b4efe624386"],"keyword":["Participatory data design","digitalisation","educational technology","future workshops","teacher participation"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-2A6B7D90B85A478DAE45FC78176497A5"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.16993/dfl.109","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/311952262/109_958_1_PB.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Humanities (HUM)"],"yearPub":"2019","yearSub":"2019"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, ICT for Development","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, Kommunikation - IT og Læringsdesign"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lone","key":"dirckinckholmfeldpau","last":"Dirckinck-Holmfeld","locid":"46ce4fc1-2bd6-4077-95cf-9615f3c582d5","name":"Dirckinck-Holmfeld, Lone","orcid":"0000-0002-0403-8888","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Bertil Johannes","key":"ipsenpau","last":"Ipsen","locid":"645e3aa8-af72-4180-816d-eaaf86666e91","name":"Ipsen, Bertil Johannes","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Andreas Lindenskov","key":"tamborgpau","last":"Tamborg","locid":"41b4cc98-44fb-4d2a-aa4d-71faead21e4b","name":"Tamborg, Andreas Lindenskov","orcid":"0000-0001-7578-7838","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jonas","key":"dreyøepau","last":"Dreyøe","locid":"f1385309-3024-4d78-b5ad-db1ea6014618","name":"Dreyøe, Jonas","orcid":"0000-0002-2359-8442","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Benjamin","key":"brinkallsopppau","last":"Brink Allsopp","locid":"d3d63ab7-23f1-4b1e-bc2f-f34ec09c5a9f","name":"Allsopp, Benjamin Brink","name_org":"Brink Allsopp, Benjamin","orcid":"0000-0002-6992-9171","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Morten","key":"misfeldtpau","last":"Misfeldt","locid":"a26e7e8e-a067-437b-a0dd-a56601621904","name":"Misfeldt, Morten","orcid":"0000-0002-6481-4121","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.16993/dfl.109","issn":["16547608","20017480"],"issn_org":["16547608"],"issue":"1","journal":"Designs for Learning","pages":"63-71","publisher":"Stockholm University Press","status":"p","title":"Designs for Learning","volume":"11"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85089343980"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-d0e45129-0ab5-479c-a315-8b4efe624386"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Modes of Teacher Participation in the Digitalization of School","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-110685","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"Denne rapport blev oprindeligt udarbejdet i 2018 på baggrund af en pilottest en såkaldt virtuel praktik, Land Science, hvor eleverne er i virtuel praktik som byplanlæggere. Praktikken blev gennemført i en emneuge med 13 elever i 10.klasse og deres lærer Marc Northern på Amager 10 i efteråret 2017 (Fougt, Dreyøe, Ipsen & Siebert-Evenstone, 2018). Nærværende rapport er opdateret med endnu en pilotafprøvning i foråret 2019 på samme skole og med samme lærer, men med en ny 10.kl., hvor 16 elever gennemførte forløbet. Formålet med første pilotafprøvning var todelt: Dels generelt at undersøge, hvordan den fra amerikansk til dansk oversatte version af Land Science fungerer i dansk skolekontekst, dels specifikt at afdække udsatte elevers udbytte, idet 10.kl. har en forholdsvis høj andel af sådanne elever, som er i fare for ikke at gennemføre en ungdomsuddannelse, og tilknyttet amerikansk forskning viser et særligt positivt udbytte for denne gruppe elever. Formålet med anden pilotafprøvning var dels at befæste første rapports positive resultater, dels at konsolidere konceptet virtuel praktik med henblik på udrulning i dansk kontekst.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Fougt, Simon","Dreyøe, Jonas","Foley, Dale James","Ipsen, Bertil Johannes","Siebert-Evenstone, Amanda"],"cuid":["S02-089.06-028022"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Wisconsin-Madison"],"keyword":["Folkeskolen","It","Scenariedidaktik","naturvidenskabelige fag"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U","DI-UC"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-KP"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-UC-KP"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"dansk version af den virtuelle praktik land science rapport pilottest på amager 000000000010 opdateret 000000002019","src":["au","kp"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-UC-KP"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://ucviden.kp.dk/ws/files/67736067/Rapport_Pilottest_1_og_2_af_Land_Science_2019_FINAL.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-089.06-028022","ids":["au-d3ebd34b-6693-4f94-8abf-6dc4beec333c","kp-fc10d958-0ca9-4daf-aac3-23147bd33eb5"],"keyword":["It","Scenariedidaktik","Virtuel praktik","folkeskolen","naturvidenskabelige fag"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-2-53A276AD7BAEE6A0EA8B84F055096CE5"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/172995816/Rapport_Pilottest_1_og_2_af_Land_Science_2019_FINAL.pdf","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://ucviden.kp.dk/ws/files/67736067/Rapport_Pilottest_1_og_2_af_Land_Science_2019_FINAL.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, Danish School of Education, Danish School of Education - Educational Theory and Curriculum Studies, Emdrup"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"kp university college copenhagen","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-KP","l3nl":"KP","l3nn":"KP University College Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KP University College Copenhagen","namevar":["University College Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-KP","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"4","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Unspecified organisation"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"us","key":"university of wisconsin madison","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"University of Wisconsin-Madison","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Simon","key":"fougtpau","last":"Fougt","locid":"92b9dcb0-7ada-4376-a75f-e991a93aa702","name":"Fougt, Simon","orcid":"0000-0002-4606-8225","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 3 4","corresponding":null,"first":"Jonas","key":"dreyøepau","last":"Dreyøe","locid":"eab9f935-e20e-41cc-a15c-ef0931946e72","name":"Dreyøe, Jonas","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Dale James","key":"foleypau","last":"Foley","name":"Foley, Dale James","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Bertil Johannes","key":"ipsenpau","last":"Ipsen","name":"Ipsen, Bertil Johannes","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Bertil","key":"johannesipsenpau","last":"Johannes Ipsen","name":"Johannes Ipsen, Bertil","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","corresponding":null,"first":"Amanda","key":"siebertevenstonepau","last":"Siebert-Evenstone","name":"Siebert-Evenstone, Amanda","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"24","place":"København","publisher":"Københavns Professionshøjskole","status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","KP","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities","University Colleges"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-d3ebd34b-6693-4f94-8abf-6dc4beec333c","kp-fc10d958-0ca9-4daf-aac3-23147bd33eb5"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","KP University College Copenhagen"],"title":"Dansk version af den virtuelle praktik Land Science : rapport, pilottest på Amager 10, opdateret 2019","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-089.06-028022","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"Denne rapport beskriver en pilotafprøvning af en dansk oversættelse af en amerikansk udviklet såkaldt virtuel praktik, Land Science, som blev gennemført i en emneuge i en 10. klasse på Amager 10 i efteråret 2017 af Jonas Dreyøe, AAU, og Simon Skov Fougt, KP, i samarbejde med klassens lærer, Marc Northern. Formålet med pilotafprøvningen var todelt: Dels at undersøge, om den danske version af Land Science kunne fungere i dansk skolekontekst, dels et særligt fokus på at-risk-students’ udbytte, idet amerikanske undersøgelser heraf har vist særligt positive effekter for denne gruppe.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Fougt, Simon Skov","Dreyøe, Jonas","Johannes Ipsen, Bertil","Siebert-Evenstone, Amanda"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-388850"],"filters":{"added":"2023-02","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","School of Education, University of Madison, Wisconsin"],"keyword":["Folkeskolen","naturvidenskabelige fag"],"level":"sci","oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-UC"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-KP"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-UC-KP"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"dansk version af den virtuelle praktik land science rapport pilottest på amager 000000000010","src":["kp"],"src-code":["DI-UC-KP"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://ucviden.kp.dk/ws/files/62310104/FINAL_Rapport_Pilottest_af_Land_Science_dansk_version_november_2018.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-388850","ids":["kp-75341f31-facb-48f1-9560-cd28aa85d2c0"],"keyword":["folkeskolen","naturvidenskabelige fag"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","noi":["Local-1-1-3944C50E84721417B917EB01FA1CC18A"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://ucviden.kp.dk/ws/files/62310104/FINAL_Rapport_Pilottest_af_Land_Science_dansk_version_november_2018.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"kp university college copenhagen","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-KP","l3nl":"KP","l3nn":"KP University College Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KP University College Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Professionshøjskole, Institut for Skole og Læring, Institut for Skole og Læring"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-KP","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"us","key":"school of education university of madison wisconsin","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"School of Education, University of Madison, Wisconsin","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Simon Skov","key":"fougtpau","last":"Fougt","locid":"7c025edc-1ca7-45ad-ab2b-b3790902b3f5","name":"Fougt, Simon Skov","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jonas","key":"dreyøepau","last":"Dreyøe","locid":"eab9f935-e20e-41cc-a15c-ef0931946e72","name":"Dreyøe, Jonas","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Bertil","key":"johannesipsenpau","last":"Johannes Ipsen","name":"Johannes Ipsen, Bertil","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Amanda","key":"siebertevenstonepau","last":"Siebert-Evenstone","name":"Siebert-Evenstone, Amanda","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"21","place":"København","publisher":"Københavns Professionshøjskole","status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","All University Col